				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Lenne"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 726930501,
					"content": "The wild fruit in here must be alluding to some painful experiences. It is not a purely joyful memory, like the first taste of alcohol or the first reading of a poem, but it nonetheless leaves a deep impression.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Lenne"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7269306,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7269305
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_NONE",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7269305",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7269305,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Lenne",
					"Ootomo"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 726930601,
					"content": "Ootomo's poem has really broken through the usual form of the Inazuman poem, yet it also uses its ancient style to depict all manner of unforgettable human experiences.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726930602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lenne"
				},
				{
					"id": 726930602,
					"content": "Perhaps he means to say that although Mondstadt and Inazuma may seem greatly different, they do share some common aesthetics — just as how the two of us, despite being from these different nations, were able to bond as poets.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726930603
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lenne"
				},
				{
					"id": 726930603,
					"content": "Ah, to think that you were able to grasp the feelings behind this verse so quickly, despite being so young...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726930604
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ootomo"
				},
				{
					"id": 726930604,
					"content": "I didn't believe in the idea of making friends of disparate ages from yourself before, but now I know that it is true. What a joyful truth it is!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726930605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ootomo"
				},
				{
					"id": 726930605,
					"content": "#And you too, learned {F#young lady}{M#young man} — that we three should have met here... There must be some destiny at play.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726930606
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ootomo"
				},
				{
					"id": 726930606,
					"content": "Indeed. The trip to Inazuma was a pretty bumpy one, but none of that matters now. Even when I return to Mondstadt, I will remember everything I've seen here in Inazuma.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726930607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lenne"
				},
				{
					"id": 726930607,
					"content": "This is also thanks to the pictures you brought.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726930608
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lenne"
				},
				{
					"id": 726930608,
					"content": "I hope that someday, we three shall meet once again.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						726930609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Ootomo"
				},
				{
					"id": 726930609,
					"content": "We will!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Lenne"
				}
			]
		},
